1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,690
Brands don't want perfect ads anymore.

2
00:00:02,810 --> 00:00:03,700
They want raw.

3
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:04,710
They want real.

4
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:05,800
They want you.

5
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:06,770
This is LOOT.

6
00:00:06,790 --> 00:00:08,460
Brands drop paid video missions.

7
00:00:08,480 --> 00:00:09,160
You film them.

8
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:09,890
You get paid.

9
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:11,750
Step one: enlist.

10
00:00:11,960 --> 00:00:12,840
Pick a codename,

11
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:14,280
build your hunter profile,

12
00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:16,650
and once we approve you, the full app unlocks.

13
00:00:16,950 --> 00:00:18,720
Step two: hit the Loot tab.

14
00:00:18,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Every contract shows the brand, the brief,

15
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:23,470
and a guaranteed reward, before you film a thing.

16
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:25,110
Every brief comes loaded:

17
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:28,200
hooks, scripts, scene-by-scene shots, do's and don'ts.

18
00:00:28,290 --> 00:00:29,990
Just copy, and shoot.

19
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:31,490
Tap Secure the Bag.

20
00:00:31,610 --> 00:00:34,960
Once the brand locks you in, the money's pre-funded and held for you.

21
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:37,250
Step three: drop the loot.

22
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:40,760
Shoot it, open the Studio, and transmit your video to the brand.

23
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:41,950
On beginner missions,

24
00:00:41,970 --> 00:00:44,070
reshoots only happen for technical glitches,

25
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:45,690
and we verify them first.

26
00:00:46,050 --> 00:00:47,870
Step four: bag secured.

27
00:00:48,040 --> 00:00:50,020
Approved videos get paid into your Stash,

28
00:00:50,140 --> 00:00:52,050
and you withdraw straight to UPI.

29
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:54,150
No boss. No schedule.

30
00:00:54,210 --> 00:00:55,050
Just the mission.

31
00:00:55,070 --> 00:00:56,720
Read the rules, don't get banned…

32
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:57,910
and secure the bag.

